OL,3,ATypical energy bill forecast to go up
OL,4,Aby #443 a year from January as
OL,5,Ainflation rate rises again
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrices rose 3.6% in the year to
OL,8,FOctober, up from 3.5% in September
OL,9,Fmainly because of higher petrol and
OL,10,Fdiesel prices, official figures show.
